Subject: [PATCH 246/248] CF (2311 root cause): a typed introduction is its own
 yes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Misho's yes, 13 Oct 11:2x UTC in the operations chat („ჩემგან ყველაფერზე
კია", relayed verbatim by ops at 11:28Z), to the sentence put to him in the
morning list. request_introduction said „Call only after the user explicitly
confirms … only after they confirm". The model obeyed: a typed „სთხოვე
გიორგის, დამაკავშიროს ნინოსთან" got a second „shall I send it?" (conv 50823)
or nothing, against D316. Both phrases are replaced by: „Call it once the
user has said they want it: a typed instruction to introduce them („ask Gio
to introduce me to Nino") is itself that yes (D316) — send at once, without
asking again."

The day-one ask rule mentioned with CF was never put to him as an exact
text, so it is not in this commit.

